  "notes": "FORMS:\n- {分岐|ぶんき} (noun): a fork, a branching point\n- {分岐点|ぶんきてん}: branching point, turning point\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {道|みち}が{分岐|ぶんき}する (a road forks)\n- {意見|いけん}が{分岐|ぶんき}する (opinions diverge)\n- {分岐点|ぶんきてん}に{立|た}つ (to stand at a crossroads)\n- ストーリーが{分岐|ぶんき}する (a story branches)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {分|わ}かれる: to split, to part — more general and everyday\n- {枝分|えだわ}かれする: to branch out — emphasizes tree-like branching",
